<title>HONDURAS: SOCCER-HONDURAS BEAT CUBA 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HONDURAS BEAT CUBA 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>TEGUCIGALPA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honduras beat Cuba 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 3-0) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Juan Castro (3rd minute), Enrique Centeno (33rd and</p>
<p>84th), Carlos Pavon (37th)</p>
